sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as KServe/ModelMesh Client
    participant Router as Router (Rust)<br/>8033/TCP gRPC<br/>Optional TLS/mTLS
    participant Validator as Validator +<br/>Tokenizer Pool
    participant Batcher as Continuous Dynamic<br/>Batcher
    participant Shard0 as Python Shard 0<br/>UDS gRPC
    participant GPU as GPU(s)<br/>CUDA 12.1
    participant ShardN as Python Shards 1..N<br/>UDS gRPC

    Note over Client,ShardN: Flow 1: Text Generation Request

    Client->>Router: GenerationService.Generate<br/>gRPC 8033/TCP<br/>Optional TLS/mTLS
    Router->>Validator: Validate request params<br/>(max_new_tokens, sequence_length)
    Validator->>Validator: Tokenize input text<br/>(Rust tokenizer pool)
    Validator->>Batcher: Enqueue validated request
    Note over Batcher: Dynamic batch assembly<br/>max_batch_size, max_prefill_padding 20%<br/>1s cutoff window for overtaking

    Batcher->>Shard0: TextGenerationService.Prefill<br/>gRPC over UDS
    Shard0->>GPU: Forward pass (prefill phase)
    Shard0->>ShardN: NCCL AllReduce<br/>(tensor parallel, multi-GPU)
    ShardN->>GPU: Forward pass (parallel shards)
    ShardN-->>Shard0: NCCL AllReduce results
    Shard0-->>Batcher: Prefill response<br/>(first token + cache)

    loop Decode loop (next tokens)
        Batcher->>Shard0: TextGenerationService.NextToken<br/>gRPC over UDS
        Shard0->>GPU: Forward pass (decode phase)
        Shard0->>ShardN: NCCL AllReduce
        ShardN-->>Shard0: Results
        Shard0-->>Batcher: Next token
    end

    Batcher-->>Router: Complete generation response
    Router-->>Client: gRPC response/stream<br/>Optional TLS/mTLS

    Note over Client,ShardN: Flow 2: Health Check

    participant Kubelet as Kubernetes Kubelet

    Kubelet->>Router: GET /health<br/>HTTP 3000/TCP<br/>Optional TLS
    Router->>Shard0: TextGenerationService.Health<br/>gRPC over UDS
    Shard0-->>Router: Health status
    Router-->>Kubelet: 200 OK

    Note over Client,ShardN: Flow 3: Metrics Scrape

    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Prom->>Router: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP 3000/TCP
    Router-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics<br/>(inference latency, batch sizes, queue depth)
